{"id":"b9bec8cd1d775e1ac7d1d3c3dee744c80dd0f717","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1252054","title":"Codex 最近好像喜欢很喜欢钻牛角尖","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"sickworm","excerpt":"OpenAI - @sickworm - 每一段话最后都要加一局不等于/不代表/不能证明/还不能说明 XXXX ，看的上火","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>每一段话最后都要加一局不等于/不代表/不能证明/还不能说明 XXXX ，看的上火</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223274\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2d8f/02e5/99039_normal.png?m=1548847857\" alt=\"coderlxm\" data-uid=\"99039\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coderlxm\">coderlxm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 23:03:44 +08:00\">18h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>哈哈哈，早就这样了，这就是为什么大部分人喜欢 opus5.5 的原因，专门派活给 codex ，不要看它输出的内容，那 gpt 就是一个很合适的纯力工模型</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223280\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c31/0dbc/173924_normal.png?m=1788497681\" alt=\"liudon\" data-uid=\"173924\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liudon\">liudon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 23:06:44 +08:00\">18h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>又慢又傻，哎。。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223291\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b633/f688/433522_normal.png?m=1685067457\" alt=\"lurenjiauser\" data-uid=\"433522\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lurenjiauser\">lurenjiauser</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 23:17:08 +08:00\">18h 20m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 3</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>防御性的废话。80%的篇幅在防御，注意力都不知道被带到那里去了。</p><p>本来一个小小的感冒，它花 90%的篇幅在论证无法排除绝症。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223425\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/aa2ede7f18bd7e2858a9b01648553b25?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"slwl123\" data-uid=\"94134\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/slwl123\">slwl123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 01:38:39 +08:00\">15h 59m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我用 codex ，经常被气的说脏话</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223427\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b2f/c489/598051_normal.png?m=1786591349\" alt=\"CHTRCT\" data-uid=\"598051\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/CHTRCT\">CHTRCT</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 01:42:04 +08:00\">15h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不是最近，其实 5.5 时代就这样了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223441\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/113a/de90/149856_normal.png?m=1684569472\" alt=\"huiyadanli\" data-uid=\"149856\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/huiyadanli\">huiyadanli</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 02:27:53 +08:00\">15h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>就是因为这个原因，去用 opus 5.5 了。防御性编程编写到让自己整个任务的重心都偏移了</p><p>钻牛角尖也有好处，就是冷门复杂的问题还是 GPT 解决能力强点。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223486\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5246c63e149f99386706523dd5d38456?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"amnaruto\" data-uid=\"604572\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/amnaruto\">amnaruto</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 05:40:20 +08:00\">11h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>哈哈 大有所感。就算已经明确不让他说了，他还是会偶尔找个地方塞上一句这种折中表达。怀念以前适合写作的模型</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223497\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ed4ee4dd2e384a9d8d47d2e7f43c5c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"maolon\" data-uid=\"442547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maolon\">maolon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 06:58:37 +08:00\">10h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>总之就是一堆正确的废话，非常的保守，而且只会在原地打转、<br>我试过让 astra 连续跑了一个月做研究，p 都没有推进到，每次莫名其妙停下来都要重新问他为什么停下来答曰：“无法证明 xxx,没有证据 xxx,所以停下 xxx”<br>在我的 benchmark 里他提供 idea 的能力还不如 gemini 4 argon</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223509\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1a77/befc/4768_normal.png?m=1792126582\" alt=\"levn\" data-uid=\"4768\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/levn\">levn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 07:22:13 +08:00\">10h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>跟 opus5 一个毛病</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223642\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/233d/26cb/273091_normal.png?m=1768533916\" alt=\"villivateur\" data-uid=\"273091\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/villivateur\">villivateur</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 08:50:19 +08:00\">8h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我让他生成一个 ssh rsa 密钥，然后帮我查一下服务器。他生成完密钥之后，花了 3 分钟检查公私钥是否匹配……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223692\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f01ad457599b9d0fa8dfe31fffb922cb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wepure\" data-uid=\"397688\"></td>\n      